--- simple-text ---
Hello world
│ #text("Hello world")

--- multiple-paragraphs ---
First paragraph

Second paragraph
│ #text("First paragraph")
│ #parbreak()
│ #text("Second paragraph")

--- heading ---
= Title
Some content
│ #heading(level: 1)[#text("Title")]
│ #text("Some content")

--- nested-headings ---
= Top
Content under top
== Nested
Content under nested
│ #heading(level: 1)[#text("Top")]
│ #text("Content under top")
│ #heading(level: 2)[#text("Nested")]
│ #text("Content under nested")

--- strong ---
This is *bold* text
│ #text("This is")
│ #strong[#text("bold")]
│ #text("text")

--- emphasis ---
This is _emphasized_ text
│ #text("This is")
│ #emph[#text("emphasized")]
│ #text("text")

--- link ---
Check https://example.com out
│ #text("Check")
│ #link(dest: "https://example.com")[#text("https://example.com")]
│ #text("out")

--- list ---
- First item
- Second item
│ #list.item[#text("First item")]
│ #list.item[#text("Second item")]

--- list-inside-regular-text ---
regular text
- First item
- Second item
│ #text("regular text")
│ #list.item[#text("First item")]
│ #list.item[#text("Second item")]

--- enum ---
1. First
2. Second
│ #enum.item(1)[#text("First")]
│ #enum.item(2)[#text("Second")]

--- mixed-enum-markers ---
+ first
42. second
+ third
│ #enum.item(-1)[#text("first")]
│ #enum.item(42)[#text("second")]
│ #enum.item(-1)[#text("third")]

--- nested-list ---
- outer
  - inner one
  - inner two
- another outer
│ #list.item[
│   #text("outer")
│   #list.item[#text("inner one")]
│   #list.item[#text("inner two")]
│ ]
│ #list.item[#text("another outer")]

--- deeply-nested-list ---
- a
  - a.a
    - a.a.a
  - a.b
- b
│ #list.item[
│   #text("a")
│   #list.item[
│     #text("a.a")
│     #list.item[#text("a.a.a")]
│   ]
│   #list.item[#text("a.b")]
│ ]
│ #list.item[#text("b")]

--- linebreak-in-heading ---
== Title \ with \ break
│ #heading(level: 2)[
│   #text("Title")
│   #linebreak()
│   #text("with")
│   #linebreak()
│   #text("break")
│ ]

--- same-level-headings ---
= First
= Second
│ #heading(level: 1)[#text("First")]
│ #heading(level: 1)[#text("Second")]

--- term-list ---
/ Term: Definition
/ Another: With more text
│ #terms.item[#text("Term")][#text("Definition")]
│ #terms.item[#text("Another")][#text("With more text")]

--- term-list-multiline ---
/ Key: Value that spans
       multiple lines
│ #terms.item[#text("Key")][
│   #text("Value that spans")
│   #text("multiple lines")
│ ]

--- inline-raw ---
This has `code` in it
│ #text("This has")
│ #raw("code")
│ #text("in it")

--- inline-raw-multiline ---
Text with `code that
spans lines` here
│ #text("Text with")
│ #raw("code that", "spans lines")
│ #text("here")

--- block-raw ---
```
code block
```
│ #raw(block: true, "code block")

--- block-raw-with-lang ---
```rust
fn main() {}
```
│ #raw(
│   block: true,
│   lang: "rust",
│   "fn main() {}",
│ )

--- block-raw-multiline ---
```go
package main

func main() {}
```
│ #raw(
│   block: true,
│   lang: "go",
│   "package main",
│   "",
│   "func main() {}",
│ )

--- escape-character ---
Use \* for literal star
│ #text("Use")
│ #text("*")
│ #text("for literal star")

--- unicode-escape ---
Letter \u{41} is A
│ #text("Letter")
│ #text("A")
│ #text("is A")

--- smart-quote ---
It's working
│ #text("It")
│ #text("'")
│ #text("s working")

--- shorthands ---
Use ... for ellipsis and --- for dash
│ #text("Use")
│ #text("…")
│ #text("for ellipsis and")
│ #text("—")
│ #text("for dash")

--- reference ---
See @intro for more
│ #text("See")
│ #ref(target: "intro")
│ #text("for more")

--- reference-with-supplement ---
See @intro[the introduction] for details
│ #text("See")
│ #ref(target: "intro")[#text("the introduction")]
│ #text("for details")

--- label-on-heading ---
= Introduction <intro>
│ #heading(level: 1)[#text("Introduction")]
│ #label("intro")

--- label-on-paragraph ---
Some text <my-label>
│ #text("Some text")
│ #label("my-label")

--- label-and-reference ---
= Chapter One <ch1>
See @ch1 for details
│ #heading(level: 1)[#text("Chapter One")]
│ #label("ch1")
│ #text("See")
│ #ref(target: "ch1")
│ #text("for details")
